      "abstractNote": "Abstract. Here we present our initial concept for metadata exchange with other Base4NFDI service. We first surveyed Base4NFDI projects to find out which Base projects would either consume or produce metadata for research software. Then conducted interviews with consumers and producers to figure out their needs based on common and distinctive metadata elements. Based on surveys and interviews, we present a diagram for a research software metadata exchange across Base4NFDI projects. Keywords. Research software, metadata, metadata exchange, interoperability",
